{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:47 2026-09-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:47 2026-09-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:47 2026-09-11 HKT</p><p>柴灣峰華邨對開，今（11日）早上11時14分，一部輕型貨車撞倒一名婆婆，婆婆頭部受傷，昏迷不醒，救護員接報到場，將她送院搶救。警方到場調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"涉事貨車司機在場協助調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/637c93ce92dd9d46e360918f371d0833/2026-09/01_1_19.jpg\"/><img alt=\"涉事貨車停在現場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76614579fda78814f8fbe148325a6ce2/2026-09/02_14.jpg\"/><img alt=\"涉事貨車停在現場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b434c030d038f4dd4c498e7fd20150f/2026-09/03_4_15.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警方在場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1656a2758822a274c053df42d44045bf/2026-09/04_5_10.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場有一灘血漬。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a72ef0a92d18b05ea41605c273ff6a1/2026-09/05_1_9.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T04:50:54.137897+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}